Third-party material

- Visual language, palette and UI kit ported from "EVANGELION — Neon Overdrive"
  by Luis Bizarro (https://github.com/bizarro/evangelion), MIT License, itself
  built on Giacomo Magnanini's pdoom-video engine.
- extras/plugins/zalo.nerv-wall/bloom/ is a port of SE Natural Bloom & Dirty Lens
  by sonicether (https://github.com/sonicether/SE-Natural-Bloom-Dirty-Lens),
  MIT License; its notice and lens-dirt texture are kept in that folder.
- extras/fonts/: Cormorant Garamond and IBM Plex Mono, SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (see extras/fonts/OFL.txt).

Evangelion and NERV are trademarks of their respective owners. This is a
fan-made homage that borrows the genre's UI language, not its logos or footage.
